{"id":"H0032","lemma":"אֲבִיחַ֫יִל","transliteration":"avihayil","sayIt":"a-vi-HA-yil","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Abihail","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.3.35;\nfather of: Zuriel (H6700)\n§ Abihail = \"my father is might\"\n1) a Levite in Moses's time\n2) a Gadite\n3) father of Esther\n4) wife of Abishur\n5) wife of Rehoboam","glosses":["abihail"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-3","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abihail","kjv":"of Abihail"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abihail","kjv":"was Abihail"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abihail","kjv":"of Abihail"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-11","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"and of Abihail","kjv":"and Abihail"}},{"chapterId":"est-2","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abihail","kjv":"of Abihail"}},{"chapterId":"est-9","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abihail","kjv":"of Abihail"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 3:35","note":"The prince of the fathers’ house of the families of Merari was Zuriel the son of Abihail. They shall encamp on the north side of the tabernacle.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:29","note":"The name of the wife of Abishur was Abihail; and she bore him Ahban and Molid.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 11:18","note":"Rehoboam took a wife for himself, Mahalath the daughter of Jerimoth the son of David and of Abihail the daughter of Eliab the son of Jesse.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Esther 2:15","note":"Now when the turn of Esther, the daughter of Abihail the uncle of Mordecai, who had taken her for his daughter, came to go in to the king, she required nothing…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H6700","lemma":"צוּרִיאֵל","transliteration":"tsuriel","gloss":"Zuriel"},{"id":"H0051","lemma":"אֲבִישׁוּר","transliteration":"avishur","gloss":"Abishur"},{"id":"H0257","lemma":"אַחְבָן","transliteration":"achvan","gloss":"Ahban"},{"id":"H4140","lemma":"מוֹלִיד","transliteration":"molid","gloss":"Mol